## Context
DESIGN.md §4 PR-10, honoring R16 and D7 (both notes and annotations). Verified
gap at edf2748: builds crawl top:true only — standalone notes are indexed,
child notes and annotations are not, so the researcher's own words are
invisible while zoteus can create annotations it can never find again. The PR:
an itemType-filtered second crawl pass for child notes + annotations, #6012
eligibility cited (they embed both as first-class).

## Exit criteria
- [ ] child notes and annotations indexed; failing test shows today's blindness
- [ ] record-core ruling respected: own words extend, never dilute (own field/column)
- [ ] PR opened upstream; outcome recorded here
